** (-) 42.9. Dependency Maintenance {* 42.9}

   Ongoing obligation. Contract tests validate behavioural compatibility
   on every dependency update.

   Stage 1:
   - Backend and frontend dependency baseline established
   - Dependabot configured for automated PR creation

   Stage 2:
   - Security patches for web framework and auth library vulnerabilities
   - React Native upgrade (new architecture migration)
   - Contract tests added for upgraded dependencies


** 42.10. Architecture Notes {* 42.10}

   - /API-first design/ — OpenAPI spec drives backend routes, client SDK,
     and API documentation simultaneously
   - /WebSocket for real-time/ — chat messages and presence via persistent
     connections; REST for everything else
   - /Offline-first mobile/ — local SQLite + sync queue; conflict resolution
     on reconnect
   - /Queue-based fan-out/ — notifications and chat delivery decoupled from
     request path via message queue
   - /CDN for static assets/ — user uploads served through CloudFront;
     signed URLs for private content
   - /Tag-based promotion/ — `main` → dev, RC tag → staging, release tag → prod


